message: >-
  If you use these experiments or numerical records, please cite the associated
  paper and this repository.
title: >-
  Reproducibility materials for Singular Parameters and Missing Limits in
  Neural PDE Solvers
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Fernández
    given-names: Daniel
    email: daniel.fernandez@fau.de
repository-code: https://github.com/danielfdzm/singular-representations-pde
